# Prove bounded tape use and improve already optimized Android native images
# Input is at most ten validated commands then zero then a complete native image
# Every unrecognized loop retains the full tape and all original pointer checks
# Clear and adjacent transfer loops have zero net pointer travel
# The bounded source then touches at most eleven cells and uses sixteen stack bytes
# Stack allocation is zeroed before any source instruction executes
# Only the first right transfer after initial input has a known zero destination
# Generic transfer traps remain intact and left moves retain their checks
# Empty slots branch to exit and proven right moves skip redundant range code
